{
  "label": "Advanced Search",
  "category": "Account Data",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Advanced Search & Filtering",
      "id": "advanced-search",
      "intro": "Advanced Search memungkinkan Anda mencari dan memfilter data account berdasarkan berbagai kriteria: Account Number, Currency, Account Type, dan Account Status. Search panel muncul di sisi kanan layar dengan form filter yang mudah digunakan.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Search Panel",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik tombol **Search** (ikon magnifying glass 🔍) di toolbar atas.\n• Search panel akan slide-in dari sisi kanan dengan lebar 320px.\n• Panel memiliki header \"Search Account\" dengan badge \"Search\" dan tombol close (X).\n• Form terdiri dari 4 field filter dan 2 action button di footer: **Reset** dan **Apply Filters**.",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(20,184,166,.12);border:1px solid #99f6e4;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #99f6e4;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdfa,#ccfbf1);\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Search Account</div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#ccfbf1;border:1px solid #99f6e4;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#14b8a6;\">● Search</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Set filters and apply</div></div><div style=\"width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"/></svg></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Account Number</div><div style=\"position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:10px;\">🔍</span><input placeholder=\"Enter account number\" style=\"width:100%;padding:7px 7px 7px 26px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#f8f9fa;\"/></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Currency</div><div style=\"position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:10px;\">🔍</span><input placeholder=\"Enter currency\" style=\"width:100%;padding:7px 7px 7px 26px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#f8f9fa;\"/></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Account Type</div><div style=\"position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:10px;\">🔍</span><input placeholder=\"Enter account type\" style=\"width:100%;padding:7px 7px 7px 26px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#f8f9fa;\"/></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Account Status</div><div style=\"position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:10px;\">🔍</span><input placeholder=\"Enter status\" style=\"width:100%;padding:7px 7px 7px 26px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#f8f9fa;\"/></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Reset</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#14b8a6;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Apply Filters</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Filter Field: Account Number",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\n• **Account Number**: Input teks untuk mencari berdasarkan nomor rekening (contoh: `1234567890`, `9876543210`).\n  - Field ini melakukan **partial match** (pencarian sebagian), jadi input `1234` akan mencocokkan semua account number yang mengandung digit tersebut.\n  - Berguna untuk mencari account dengan nomor tertentu atau prefix tertentu.\n  - Pencarian **case-insensitive** dan mendukung angka.\n\n> **Tips**: Gunakan partial match untuk mencari multiple accounts dengan pola nomor yang sama (contoh: semua account yang dimulai dengan 123).",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(59,130,246,.1);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #bfdbfe;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eff6ff,#dbeafe);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Account Number Filter</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Partial match search</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Account Number</div><div style=\"position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:10px;\">🔢</span><input placeholder=\"Enter account number\" value=\"1234\" style=\"width:100%;padding:7px 7px 7px 26px;border:1.5px solid #3b82f6;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#eff6ff;\"/></div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:3px;padding-left:2px;\">💡 Partial match: finds all accounts containing \"1234\"</div></div><div style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #bae6fd;padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#0284c7;margin-bottom:4px;\">Search Results Preview:</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#475569;line-height:1.4;font-family:monospace;\">✓ 1234567890</div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#475569;line-height:1.4;font-family:monospace;\">✓ 9991234888</div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#475569;line-height:1.4;font-family:monospace;\">✓ 5551234000</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Filter Field: Currency & Account Type",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:3}\n• **Currency**: Input teks untuk mencari berdasarkan mata uang rekening (contoh: `IDR`, `USD`, `EUR`).\n  - Format biasanya menggunakan kode mata uang standar ISO 4217 (3 huruf).\n  - Berguna untuk filtering account berdasarkan currency tertentu.\n  - Partial match memungkinkan pencarian fleksibel.\n\n• **Account Type**: Input teks untuk mencari berdasarkan jenis rekening (contoh: `SAVINGS`, `CURRENT`, `LOAN`).\n  - Tipe rekening menunjukkan kategori account.\n  - **SAVINGS**: Rekening tabungan (savings account)\n  - **CURRENT**: Rekening giro (checking account)\n  - **LOAN**: Rekening pinjaman/kredit\n  - **DEPOSIT**: Rekening deposito\n\n> Kombinasikan Currency dan Account Type untuk pencarian lebih spesifik (contoh: semua savings account dalam IDR).",
          "color": "#06b6d4",
          "bg": "#f0f9ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "3": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(6,182,212,.1);border:1px solid #a5f3fc;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #a5f3fc;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f9ff,#cffafe);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Currency & Type Filter</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Filter by currency and account type</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Currency</div><div style=\"position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:10px;\">💰</span><input placeholder=\"IDR, USD, EUR\" value=\"IDR\" style=\"width:100%;padding:7px 7px 7px 26px;border:1.5px solid #06b6d4;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#f0f9ff;\"/></div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:3px;padding-left:2px;\">💡 ISO 4217 currency codes</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Account Type</div><div style=\"position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:10px;\">📁</span><input placeholder=\"SAVINGS, CURRENT\" value=\"SAVINGS\" style=\"width:100%;padding:7px 7px 7px 26px;border:1.5px solid #06b6d4;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#f0f9ff;\"/></div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#64748b;margin-top:3px;padding-left:2px;\">💡 Common: SAVINGS, CURRENT, LOAN</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Filter Field: Account Status",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:4}\n• **Account Status**: Input teks untuk mencari berdasarkan status rekening.\n  - **ACTIVE**: Rekening aktif dan dapat digunakan untuk transaksi.\n  - **INACTIVE**: Rekening tidak aktif, perlu aktivasi.\n  - **CLOSED**: Rekening sudah ditutup.\n  - **DORMANT**: Rekening dorman (tidak ada aktivitas dalam periode tertentu).\n  - **SUSPENDED**: Rekening ditangguhkan sementara (karena fraud/investigasi).\n  - **BLOCKED**: Rekening diblokir karena fraud/security issue.\n\n• **Kegunaan Status Filter:**\n  - Monitoring account yang perlu action (dormant, suspended).\n  - Identifikasi account berisiko (blocked, suspended).\n  - Audit trail account lifecycle (active → dormant → closed).\n\n> Status filter berguna untuk fraud analyst dalam mengidentifikasi account yang memerlukan investigasi lebih lanjut.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "4": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(245,158,11,.1);border:1px solid #fde68a;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fde68a;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbeb,#fef3c7);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Account Status Filter</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Filter by account lifecycle status</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Account Status</div><div style=\"position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:10px;\">⚡</span><input placeholder=\"Enter status\" value=\"SUSPENDED\" style=\"width:100%;padding:7px 7px 7px 26px;border:1.5px solid #ea580c;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;box-sizing:border-box;background:#fff7ed;\"/></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;margin-bottom:6px;\">⚠️ High Priority Status:</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#991b1b;line-height:1.4;\">🔴 BLOCKED - Fraud confirmed</div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#c2410c;line-height:1.4;\">🟠 SUSPENDED - Under investigation</div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#d97706;line-height:1.4;\">🟡 DORMANT - Inactive risk</div></div></div><div style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #a7f3d0;padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;margin-bottom:6px;\">✓ Normal Status:</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#065f46;line-height:1.4;\">🟢 ACTIVE - Normal operation</div><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#475569;line-height:1.4;\">⚪ CLOSED - Account closed</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Action Buttons: Reset & Apply Filters",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:5}\n• **Reset**: Menghapus semua filter yang telah diisi dan mengembalikan tampilan ke state awal (menampilkan semua account).\n  - Klik Reset untuk me-reset form pencarian ke nilai default (kosong).\n  - Data di main view akan di-reload dengan menampilkan semua account tanpa filter.\n  - Selected account akan di-clear.\n\n• **Apply Filters**: Menjalankan search query dengan kriteria yang telah diisi.\n  - Button akan menampilkan **loading spinner** saat proses filtering berjalan.\n  - Hasil filter langsung ditampilkan di main view (Card/Table).\n  - Search panel tetap terbuka agar Anda dapat memodifikasi filter dengan cepat jika diperlukan.\n  - Pagination akan di-reset ke halaman 1 setelah filter diterapkan.\n\n> **Semua field filter bersifat opsional** dan dapat dikombinasikan. Sistem melakukan AND operation untuk multiple filters (semua kriteria harus cocok). Filter berjalan server-side untuk mencari di seluruh database.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "5": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(139,92,246,.1);border:1px solid #ddd6fe;background:#fff;width:280px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd6fe;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#ede9fe);\"><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Filter Actions</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Reset or apply your filters</div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;margin-bottom:6px;\">Active Filters:</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#3b82f6;\">Account: 1234</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Type: SAVINGS</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #a7f3d0;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;\">Status: ACTIVE</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M3 6h18M19 6v14a2 2 0 01-2 2H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V6m3 0V4a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v2\"/></svg>Reset</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:7px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#7c3aed);border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(139,92,246,.3);\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>Apply</button></div><div style=\"border-radius:6px;background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fde68a;padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:7.5px;color:#92400e;line-height:1.4;text-align:center;\">💡 Filters use AND logic - all criteria must match</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
